Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:01.49,Doc,,0,0,0,,More than ten thousand dollars.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.54,0:00:04.73,Doc,,0,0,0,,That's how much you can now save\Non one brand-new ute in Australia,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.78,0:00:06.55,Doc,,0,0,0,,compared with its old list price.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.60,0:00:07.91,Doc,,0,0,0,,Not a used car.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.96,0:00:10.55,Doc,,0,0,0,,Not a demo with forty\Nthousand kilometres on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.60,0:00:13.55,Doc,,0,0,0,,A new ute, from one of the\Nbiggest car brands in the country.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.60,0:00:15.05,Doc,,0,0,0,,And the reason is brutal.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.10,0:00:16.23,Doc,,0,0,0,,When this ute launched,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.28,0:00:19.63,Doc,,0,0,0,,the brand was talking about selling\Ntwenty thousand a year in Australia.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.68,0:00:23.59,Doc,,0,0,0,,In the first nine months of 2026,\Nit sold fewer than four hundred.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.64,0:00:24.87,Doc,,0,0,0,,It's not the only one.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.92,0:00:28.87,Doc,,0,0,0,,Right now, you can buy a brand-new\Ncar for under twenty thousand dollars
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.92,0:00:29.33,Doc,,0,0,0,,drive-away.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.38,0:00:33.09,Doc,,0,0,0,,Toyota a brand that almost never discounts\Nis offering four thousand dollars
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.14,0:00:34.65,Doc,,0,0,0,,on the HiLux.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.70,0:00:36.89,Doc,,0,0,0,,Ford is offering five\Nthousand on the Ranger.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.94,0:00:40.65,Doc,,0,0,0,,And Black Friday deals are landing on\Ncars that used to have waiting lists.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.70,0:00:41.63,Doc,,0,0,0,,So in this video,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.68,0:00:45.09,Doc,,0,0,0,,I'm counting down the ten biggest\Nnew-car deals in Australia right now,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.14,0:00:46.77,Doc,,0,0,0,,from smallest to biggest.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.82,0:00:49.15,Doc,,0,0,0,,Real offers, from the brands\Nand the motoring press,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.20,0:00:52.15,Doc,,0,0,0,,with the prices, the end\Ndates and the catches,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.20,0:00:55.17,Doc,,0,0,0,,because almost every one\Nof these deals has one.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.22,0:00:55.95,Doc,,0,0,0,,Stay to the end,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.00,0:00:59.11,Doc,,0,0,0,,because number one is the deal that tells\Nyou the most about where this market
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.16,0:00:59.96,Doc,,0,0,0,,is heading.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.51,0:01:02.84,Doc,,0,0,0,,First, why is this happening now?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.89,0:01:08.88,Doc,,0,0,0,,Australians bought 107,493\Nnew vehicles in October 2026,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.93,0:01:10.22,Doc,,0,0,0,,a record for the month.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.27,0:01:11.40,Doc,,0,0,0,,So people are buying.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.45,0:01:14.32,Doc,,0,0,0,,But they're buying very different\Ncars from even a year ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.37,0:01:19.00,Doc,,0,0,0,,Electric car sales were up 237\Nper cent on October last year,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.05,0:01:21.90,Doc,,0,0,0,,BYD sold more than ten thousand\Ncars in a single month,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.95,0:01:24.84,Doc,,0,0,0,,and cars built in China\Nwere up 104 per cent.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.89,0:01:28.54,Doc,,0,0,0,,That means a lot of brands are sitting\Non stock they can't move especially
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.59,0:01:31.50,Doc,,0,0,0,,utes, big SUVs and older models.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.55,0:01:34.03,Doc,,0,0,0,,Mitsubishi sales were down\N50 per cent in October.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.08,0:01:36.18,Doc,,0,0,0,,Renault was down 58 per cent.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.23,0:01:38.50,Doc,,0,0,0,,Hyundai was down almost 29.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.55,0:01:42.22,Doc,,0,0,0,,Even Ford, the maker of Australia's\Nfavourite ute, was down 3 per cent.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.27,0:01:43.76,Doc,,0,0,0,,And there's a second pressure.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.81,0:01:45.14,Doc,,0,0,0,,It's the end of the year.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.19,0:01:46.86,Doc,,0,0,0,,Dealers have annual targets,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.91,0:01:52.02,Doc,,0,0,0,,factories want to clear 2025 and 2026-built\Ncars before the new plates arrive,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.07,0:01:54.56,Doc,,0,0,0,,and Black Friday falls\Non the 27th of November.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.61,0:01:58.14,Doc,,0,0,0,,So brands are throwing\Neverything at buyers price cuts,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.19,0:02:03.36,Doc,,0,0,0,,cashback, fuel cards, deposit contributions,\Ngift cards and free servicing.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.41,0:02:05.08,Doc,,0,0,0,,A quick note before we start.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.13,0:02:08.52,Doc,,0,0,0,,These deals are current\Nas of mid-November 2026.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.57,0:02:10.90,Doc,,0,0,0,,Most of them end on the 30th of November,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.95,0:02:14.24,Doc,,0,0,0,,the 21st of December or\Nthe 31st of December.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.29,0:02:16.44,Doc,,0,0,0,,Drive-away prices can change by state,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.49,0:02:18.88,Doc,,0,0,0,,and some deals are only\Nfor private buyers.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.93,0:02:21.34,Doc,,0,0,0,,So always get the final price\Nin writing from the dealer.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.39,0:02:22.55,Doc,,0,0,0,,Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.35,0:02:25.88,Doc,,0,0,0,,Number ten: the fuel card war.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.93,0:02:30.52,Doc,,0,0,0,,Some brands don't want to cut the\Nprice, because that hurts resale values.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.57,0:02:32.78,Doc,,0,0,0,,So instead, they hand you a fuel card.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.83,0:02:36.66,Doc,,0,0,0,,Chery is offering a two-thousand-dollar\Nfuel card on the Tiggo 7,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.71,0:02:41.58,Doc,,0,0,0,,with the Tiggo 7 Urban\Nat $29,990 drive-away,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.63,0:02:44.54,Doc,,0,0,0,,and a fifteen-hundred-dollar\Nfuel card on the Tiggo 4,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.59,0:02:48.20,Doc,,0,0,0,,which starts at $23,990 drive-away.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.25,0:02:52.72,Doc,,0,0,0,,The Chery E5 electric SUV gets two\Nthousand dollars cashback instead.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.77,0:02:55.56,Doc,,0,0,0,,Those offers run until\Nthe 21st of December,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.61,0:02:57.80,Doc,,0,0,0,,according to the deals tracker CarSorted.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.85,0:02:59.88,Doc,,0,0,0,,Mitsubishi is doing the same thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.93,0:03:02.62,Doc,,0,0,0,,There's a three-thousand-dollar\Nfuel card on the Triton ute,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.67,0:03:06.28,Doc,,0,0,0,,and a two-thousand-dollar fuel card\Non the Outlander LS Black Edition,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.33,0:03:12.44,Doc,,0,0,0,,which is listed at $47,990\Ndrive-away until the end of November.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.49,0:03:14.60,Doc,,0,0,0,,Now, here's the catch with fuel cards.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.65,0:03:17.80,Doc,,0,0,0,,A two-thousand-dollar fuel card is not\Nthe same as two thousand dollars off
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.85,0:03:18.20,Doc,,0,0,0,,the price.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.25,0:03:20.46,Doc,,0,0,0,,You can't spend it on anything else,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.51,0:03:23.72,Doc,,0,0,0,,it doesn't reduce your loan, and\Nit doesn't reduce the stamp duty.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.77,0:03:25.36,Doc,,0,0,0,,If a dealer offers you a fuel card,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.41,0:03:29.08,Doc,,0,0,0,,it's always worth asking: could I\Nhave that as a discount instead?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.13,0:03:30.42,Doc,,0,0,0,,Sometimes the answer is yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.47,0:03:32.32,Doc,,0,0,0,,And remember the context.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.37,0:03:34.62,Doc,,0,0,0,,Mitsubishi's sales halved in October.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.67,0:03:36.50,Doc,,0,0,0,,When a brand's sales fall that far,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.55,0:03:39.63,Doc,,0,0,0,,there's usually more room to\Nnegotiate than the advertised offer.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.24,0:03:42.32,Doc,,0,0,0,,Number nine: Honda's plate clearance.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.37,0:03:46.16,Doc,,0,0,0,,Honda sells its cars at fixed,\Nno-haggle prices in Australia.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.21,0:03:49.40,Doc,,0,0,0,,So instead of cutting the price,\Nit's giving away gift cards.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.45,0:03:52.38,Doc,,0,0,0,,Its end-of-year plate clearance,\Nreported by CarExpert,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.43,0:03:57.30,Doc,,0,0,0,,runs until the 31st of January\N2027 on 2026-built cars.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.35,0:03:59.04,Doc,,0,0,0,,The biggest gift card is\Nthree thousand dollars,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.09,0:04:04.68,Doc,,0,0,0,,on the CR-V e:HEV X hybrid\Nand the ZR-V e:HEV X hybrid.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.73,0:04:08.44,Doc,,0,0,0,,Other CR-V and ZR-V hybrids\Nget fifteen hundred dollars.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.49,0:04:12.98,Doc,,0,0,0,,And the Civic, the HR-V, the Prelude\Nand the Accord get a thousand dollars.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.03,0:04:14.12,Doc,,0,0,0,,On top of that,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.17,0:04:17.72,Doc,,0,0,0,,Honda is throwing in the first five\Nscheduled services for free that's five
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.77,0:04:19.86,Doc,,0,0,0,,years or fifty thousand kilometres.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.91,0:04:23.62,Doc,,0,0,0,,CarExpert valued that at $1,395.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.67,0:04:25.16,Doc,,0,0,0,,So on the best-value models,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.21,0:04:28.14,Doc,,0,0,0,,you're looking at around four\Nthousand dollars in total benefits.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.19,0:04:30.38,Doc,,0,0,0,,Not bad from a brand that\Nalmost never does deals.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.43,0:04:32.10,Doc,,0,0,0,,Here's the catch.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.15,0:04:38.04,Doc,,0,0,0,,Honda's annual service price has\Njust gone up, from $199 to $279.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.09,0:04:41.64,Doc,,0,0,0,,So that free servicing is worth\Nmore than it was a month ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.69,0:04:45.44,Doc,,0,0,0,,And remember, the gift card arrives\Nwithin thirty days of delivery it doesn't
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.49,0:04:47.36,Doc,,0,0,0,,come off the price you pay on the day.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.41,0:04:48.98,Doc,,0,0,0,,And if you're thinking about the Accord,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.03,0:04:50.98,Doc,,0,0,0,,it was the number one\Ncar in my last video,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.03,0:04:53.61,Doc,,0,0,0,,with just fifty-nine sold in nine months.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.33,0:04:56.01,Doc,,0,0,0,,Number eight: GWM.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.06,0:04:58.83,Doc,,0,0,0,,GWM is a Chinese brand,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.88,0:05:02.31,Doc,,0,0,0,,but it's not riding the\NChinese boom like BYD or Geely.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.36,0:05:05.43,Doc,,0,0,0,,In October, GWM's sales\Nwere basically flat,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.48,0:05:10.03,Doc,,0,0,0,,down 0.3 per cent the only Chinese brand\Nin the top ten that went backwards.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.08,0:05:11.85,Doc,,0,0,0,,And it's responding with deals.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.90,0:05:13.63,Doc,,0,0,0,,According to GWM's own offers,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.68,0:05:15.27,Doc,,0,0,0,,listed by CarSorted,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.32,0:05:20.33,Doc,,0,0,0,,the Haval Jolion Premium\NHybrid is $32,990 drive-away,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.38,0:05:22.85,Doc,,0,0,0,,with a three-thousand-dollar\Ndeposit contribution.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.90,0:05:28.27,Doc,,0,0,0,,The bigger Haval H6 Ultra\NHybrid is $43,990 drive-away,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.32,0:05:31.03,Doc,,0,0,0,,also with three thousand\Ndollars towards your deposit.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.08,0:05:36.65,Doc,,0,0,0,,The H6 Lux petrol is $35,990\Ndrive-away with two thousand.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.70,0:05:40.79,Doc,,0,0,0,,And the Cannon ute is\Nfrom $39,990 drive-away,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.84,0:05:43.19,Doc,,0,0,0,,with a smaller\Nfive-hundred-dollar contribution.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.24,0:05:45.53,Doc,,0,0,0,,All of those run until\Nthe 30th of November.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.58,0:05:46.41,Doc,,0,0,0,,Back in October,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.46,0:05:51.73,Doc,,0,0,0,,CarExpert reported GWM offering up to\Nfive thousand dollars off selected SUVs.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.78,0:05:53.83,Doc,,0,0,0,,So this brand is clearly in a hurry.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.88,0:05:54.65,Doc,,0,0,0,,The catch?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.70,0:05:57.29,Doc,,0,0,0,,A deposit contribution is\Neffectively a discount,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.34,0:06:00.45,Doc,,0,0,0,,but it's usually tied to\Nfinance or to specific stock.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.50,0:06:03.31,Doc,,0,0,0,,And remember, these deals\Nchange month to month.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.36,0:06:04.87,Doc,,0,0,0,,If you miss the end of November,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.92,0:06:07.91,Doc,,0,0,0,,there's a good chance another deal\Nturns up in December but there's no
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.96,0:06:09.84,Doc,,0,0,0,,guarantee it will be the same one.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.65,0:06:13.24,Doc,,0,0,0,,Number seven: the Toyota HiLux.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.29,0:06:14.34,Doc,,0,0,0,,This one is rare.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.39,0:06:16.12,Doc,,0,0,0,,Toyota doesn't need to discount much,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.17,0:06:19.36,Doc,,0,0,0,,because Toyota sells more\Ncars than anyone in Australia.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.41,0:06:22.74,Doc,,0,0,0,,In October, the HiLux was the\Nbest-selling vehicle in the country,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.79,0:06:25.62,Doc,,0,0,0,,with 5,954 sales.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.67,0:06:27.78,Doc,,0,0,0,,But the ute market is getting crowded.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.83,0:06:29.32,Doc,,0,0,0,,So according to CarExpert,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.37,0:06:33.74,Doc,,0,0,0,,Toyota is offering a four-thousand-dollar\Nfinance deposit bonus on HiLux SR5
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.79,0:06:38.18,Doc,,0,0,0,,four-by-four dual-cab pickups and\Ncab-chassis models diesel only.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.23,0:06:39.15,Doc,,0,0,0,,With the bonus,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.20,0:06:45.32,Doc,,0,0,0,,CarExpert says the effective prices\Nbefore on-road costs are $59,990 for
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.37,0:06:47.34,Doc,,0,0,0,,the manual dual-cab pickup,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.39,0:06:50.52,Doc,,0,0,0,,$60,490 for the automatic cab-chassis,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.57,0:06:54.94,Doc,,0,0,0,,and $61,990 for the\Nautomatic dual-cab pickup.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.99,0:06:57.40,Doc,,0,0,0,,Now, here's the catch and it's a big one.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.45,0:07:00.16,Doc,,0,0,0,,You have to finance the\Ncar through Toyota Finance,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.21,0:07:02.66,Doc,,0,0,0,,and you have to borrow at\Nleast ten thousand dollars.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.71,0:07:03.76,Doc,,0,0,0,,Leases don't count.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.81,0:07:06.12,Doc,,0,0,0,,And the electric HiLux isn't included.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.17,0:07:10.12,Doc,,0,0,0,,You'll need to order and apply for\Nfinance by the 31st of December,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.17,0:07:12.18,Doc,,0,0,0,,with settlement by the end of February.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.23,0:07:15.48,Doc,,0,0,0,,So if you were going to pay cash,\Nthis deal isn't really for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.53,0:07:17.38,Doc,,0,0,0,,But if you were going to finance anyway,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.43,0:07:19.70,Doc,,0,0,0,,compare Toyota's interest\Nrate with your bank's.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.75,0:07:23.16,Doc,,0,0,0,,A four-thousand-dollar bonus can\Ndisappear quickly if the interest rate is
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.21,0:07:24.01,Doc,,0,0,0,,higher.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.49,0:07:28.02,Doc,,0,0,0,,Number six: BYD's\Nfour-thousand-dollar cashback.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.07,0:07:32.28,Doc,,0,0,0,,BYD is the second biggest brand in the\Ncountry and it's growing like crazy up
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.33,0:07:34.98,Doc,,0,0,0,,153 per cent in October.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.03,0:07:36.74,Doc,,0,0,0,,So why is it offering cashback?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.79,0:07:38.10,Doc,,0,0,0,,Because it's in a price war,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.15,0:07:40.74,Doc,,0,0,0,,and it wants to keep the\Npressure on everyone else.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.79,0:07:42.34,Doc,,0,0,0,,According to CarExpert,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.39,0:07:46.24,Doc,,0,0,0,,BYD is offering four thousand\Ndollars cashback on the Seal 6,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.29,0:07:51.16,Doc,,0,0,0,,the Shark 6 ute and the\NSealion 5, 6, 7 and 8 SUVs.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.21,0:07:52.26,Doc,,0,0,0,,With the cashback,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.31,0:07:58.60,Doc,,0,0,0,,the Sealion 5 Essential works out\Nat $29,990 before on-road costs.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.65,0:08:02.56,Doc,,0,0,0,,The Sealion 7 Premium one of the\Nbest-selling electric cars in the country
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.61,0:08:05.16,Doc,,0,0,0,,works out at $50,990.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.21,0:08:09.90,Doc,,0,0,0,,And the Shark 6 Premium\Nplug-in hybrid ute is $53,900.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.95,0:08:14.26,Doc,,0,0,0,,There's also 0.99 per cent finance\Nover thirty-six months on most of those
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.31,0:08:14.79,Doc,,0,0,0,,models.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.84,0:08:17.44,Doc,,0,0,0,,Orders have to be placed\Nby the 21st of December,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.49,0:08:19.64,Doc,,0,0,0,,with delivery by the end of the year.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.69,0:08:20.36,Doc,,0,0,0,,The catch?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.41,0:08:22.86,Doc,,0,0,0,,The cashback can't be combined\Nwith other BYD offers,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.91,0:08:26.54,Doc,,0,0,0,,it's not for fleet buyers, and\Ndemonstrators aren't included.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.59,0:08:30.10,Doc,,0,0,0,,And Zecar reported claims that some\Ndealers are adding another two thousand on
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.15,0:08:32.56,Doc,,0,0,0,,top but BYD hasn't confirmed that.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.61,0:08:35.55,Doc,,0,0,0,,So if a dealer offers you six\Nthousand, get it in writing.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.23,0:08:38.58,Doc,,0,0,0,,Number five: the Renault Duster.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.63,0:08:42.66,Doc,,0,0,0,,The Duster is a small, tough SUV, and\Nyou can get it with four-wheel drive.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.71,0:08:45.72,Doc,,0,0,0,,Now it's had up to five thousand\Ndollars cut from its price,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.77,0:08:47.26,Doc,,0,0,0,,according to Cars24,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.31,0:08:52.76,Doc,,0,0,0,,and the entry-level Evolution two-wheel\Ndrive is now $29,990 drive-away
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.81,0:08:53.88,Doc,,0,0,0,,nationwide.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.93,0:08:57.88,Doc,,0,0,0,,That's a real off-road-capable SUV\Nfor under thirty thousand dollars
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.93,0:08:58.30,Doc,,0,0,0,,drive-away.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.35,0:09:01.87,Doc,,0,0,0,,The four-wheel-drive versions are around\Nthirty-four to thirty-six thousand
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.92,0:09:03.14,Doc,,0,0,0,,drive-away in New South Wales.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.19,0:09:07.28,Doc,,0,0,0,,The offer covers cars bought and delivered\Nbetween the 1st of November and the
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.33,0:09:08.94,Doc,,0,0,0,,31st of December.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.99,0:09:09.86,Doc,,0,0,0,,Why the deal?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.91,0:09:10.80,Doc,,0,0,0,,Renault didn't say.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.85,0:09:12.28,Doc,,0,0,0,,But the sales figures do.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.33,0:09:16.90,Doc,,0,0,0,,In October, the whole Renault brand\Nsold just 164 cars in Australia,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.95,0:09:19.64,Doc,,0,0,0,,down 58 per cent on the\Nsame month last year.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.69,0:09:23.96,Doc,,0,0,0,,The Arkana sold four, the Koleos\N21, and the Kangoo van just two.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.01,0:09:24.66,Doc,,0,0,0,,The catch?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.71,0:09:26.86,Doc,,0,0,0,,The advertised price is\Nfor Solid White only.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.91,0:09:30.00,Doc,,0,0,0,,Any other colour adds $850.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.05,0:09:33.34,Doc,,0,0,0,,And fleet, government and rental\Nbuyers can't get the deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.39,0:09:35.50,Doc,,0,0,0,,Also think about the brand's future here.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.55,0:09:36.82,Doc,,0,0,0,,With sales this low,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.87,0:09:38.80,Doc,,0,0,0,,ask about the dealer network near you,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.85,0:09:41.55,Doc,,0,0,0,,servicing costs and parts\Nsupply before you sign.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.32,0:09:43.84,Doc,,0,0,0,,Number four: the Ford Ranger.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.89,0:09:46.35,Doc,,0,0,0,,This is Australia's\Nother favourite vehicle.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.40,0:09:49.33,Doc,,0,0,0,,The Ranger has been the best-selling\Nvehicle in the country for four months
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.38,0:09:50.05,Doc,,0,0,0,,this year.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.10,0:09:51.91,Doc,,0,0,0,,But it's in a fight with the HiLux,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.96,0:09:55.85,Doc,,0,0,0,,with BYD's Shark 6, and with\Na wave of new Chinese utes.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.90,0:09:57.47,Doc,,0,0,0,,So according to CarExpert,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.52,0:10:00.99,Doc,,0,0,0,,Ford is offering a five-thousand-dollar\Nfuel card or a discount of the same
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.04,0:10:06.69,Doc,,0,0,0,,value on the 2026.5 model year\NRanger XLT, Wildtrak and Tremor.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.74,0:10:09.77,Doc,,0,0,0,,For the newer 2027 versions\Nof the same models,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.82,0:10:11.77,Doc,,0,0,0,,the offer is four thousand dollars.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.82,0:10:16.81,Doc,,0,0,0,,And the Ranger Black Edition V6 dual-cab\Npickup has a drive-away price of
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.86,0:10:17.87,Doc,,0,0,0,,$59,000.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.92,0:10:19.33,Doc,,0,0,0,,Here's the smart move.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.38,0:10:22.55,Doc,,0,0,0,,Ford's offer gives you a choice\Nbetween a fuel card and a discount.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.60,0:10:23.59,Doc,,0,0,0,,Take the discount.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.64,0:10:26.63,Doc,,0,0,0,,As I said earlier, a discount\Nreduces the price you pay,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.68,0:10:28.87,Doc,,0,0,0,,the amount you borrow and the stamp duty.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.92,0:10:30.57,Doc,,0,0,0,,A fuel card does none of that.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.62,0:10:31.29,Doc,,0,0,0,,The catch?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.34,0:10:34.13,Doc,,0,0,0,,CarExpert didn't publish an end\Ndate for these Ranger offers,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.18,0:10:35.83,Doc,,0,0,0,,so they could end at any time.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.88,0:10:38.91,Doc,,0,0,0,,And the five-thousand-dollar\Noffer is on the older model year.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.96,0:10:42.45,Doc,,0,0,0,,If you're buying to keep for a long\Ntime, the model year matters less.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.50,0:10:45.24,Doc,,0,0,0,,If you'll sell it in two or\Nthree years, it can matter more.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.72,0:10:48.19,Doc,,0,0,0,,Number three: Suzuki's Black Friday sale.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.24,0:10:52.45,Doc,,0,0,0,,Suzuki is running a Black Friday sale\Nwith ten per cent off the price of black
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.50,0:10:53.21,Doc,,0,0,0,,cars.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.26,0:10:55.39,Doc,,0,0,0,,Yes, it only applies to black cars.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.44,0:10:57.69,Doc,,0,0,0,,The biggest saving,\Naccording to CarExpert,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.74,0:11:01.17,Doc,,0,0,0,,is on the new e Vitara Ultra electric SUV:
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.22,0:11:07.39,Doc,,0,0,0,,$5,774 off, bringing it\Nto $51,962 drive-away.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.44,0:11:11.89,Doc,,0,0,0,,The e Vitara Motion is $42,862 drive-away,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.94,0:11:14.67,Doc,,0,0,0,,a saving of $4,874.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.72,0:11:19.65,Doc,,0,0,0,,The Vitara Turbo hybrid\Nis $36,762 drive-away,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.70,0:11:22.49,Doc,,0,0,0,,saving $3,974.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.54,0:11:25.25,Doc,,0,0,0,,And here's the one that'll\Nget attention: the Jimny.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.30,0:11:30.05,Doc,,0,0,0,,The three-door Jimny in\Nblack is $35,762 drive-away,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.10,0:11:32.95,Doc,,0,0,0,,a saving of $3,474.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.00,0:11:37.95,Doc,,0,0,0,,The five-door Jimny XL\Nis $37,562 drive-away,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.00,0:11:40.53,Doc,,0,0,0,,saving $3,674.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.58,0:11:44.43,Doc,,0,0,0,,The Swift Hybrid starts\Nat $23,022 drive-away.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.48,0:11:46.31,Doc,,0,0,0,,The catches are important on this one.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.36,0:11:47.87,Doc,,0,0,0,,It's for private buyers only.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.92,0:11:51.15,Doc,,0,0,0,,You have to buy and take\Ndelivery by the 30th of November.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.20,0:11:55.20,Doc,,0,0,0,,It only covers selected new and\Ndemonstrator stock at participating dealers.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.25,0:11:58.77,Doc,,0,0,0,,Cars with a black roof and a\Ndifferent body colour don't count,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.82,0:12:02.35,Doc,,0,0,0,,the Jimny Heritage isn't included\Nand the offer excludes Queensland and
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.40,0:12:03.81,Doc,,0,0,0,,northern New South Wales.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.86,0:12:05.54,Doc,,0,0,0,,So if you're in Brisbane, sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.20,0:12:09.56,Doc,,0,0,0,,Number two: the cheapest\Nnew car in Australia.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.61,0:12:14.88,Doc,,0,0,0,,The BYD Atto 1 Essential\Nis now $19,990 drive-away.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.93,0:12:15.70,Doc,,0,0,0,,That's a brand-new,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.75,0:12:19.87,Doc,,0,0,0,,fully electric small car for under\Ntwenty thousand dollars, on the road.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.92,0:12:22.70,Doc,,0,0,0,,Zecar describes it as\NAustralia's cheapest new car,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.75,0:12:28.86,Doc,,0,0,0,,and says the saving is\Nbetween $5,772 and $7,204,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.91,0:12:30.52,Doc,,0,0,0,,depending on your state.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.57,0:12:33.04,Doc,,0,0,0,,The offer runs for orders\Nuntil the 15th of December,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.09,0:12:35.94,Doc,,0,0,0,,with delivery by the 31st of December.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.99,0:12:41.08,Doc,,0,0,0,,BYD is also offering the Dolphin\NEssential electric hatch at $28,888
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.13,0:12:47.26,Doc,,0,0,0,,drive-away, and the Atto 2 plug-in\Nhybrid at $25,990 drive-away.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.31,0:12:48.72,Doc,,0,0,0,,Think about what that means.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.77,0:12:53.06,Doc,,0,0,0,,For years, the cheapest new cars in\NAustralia were small petrol hatchbacks.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.11,0:12:54.34,Doc,,0,0,0,,Now, according to Zecar,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.39,0:12:58.44,Doc,,0,0,0,,the cheapest new car you can buy is\Nelectric, and it's made in China.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.49,0:12:59.18,Doc,,0,0,0,,The catch?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.23,0:13:01.36,Doc,,0,0,0,,The Atto 1 is a small city car.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.41,0:13:02.44,Doc,,0,0,0,,It's not a family SUV,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.49,0:13:06.96,Doc,,0,0,0,,and its range and space are built for\Nthe city, not for long country drives.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.01,0:13:10.72,Doc,,0,0,0,,If most of your driving is in town,\Nit could save you a fortune in fuel.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.77,0:13:13.68,Doc,,0,0,0,,If you regularly drive hundreds\Nof kilometres in one go,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.73,0:13:15.47,Doc,,0,0,0,,test it properly before you sign.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.22,0:13:18.51,Doc,,0,0,0,,And number one: the Kia Tasman.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.56,0:13:20.49,Doc,,0,0,0,,The Tasman is Kia's first-ever ute,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.54,0:13:23.09,Doc,,0,0,0,,and it was developed\Nwith Australia in mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.14,0:13:24.23,Doc,,0,0,0,,When it was announced,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.28,0:13:27.81,Doc,,0,0,0,,Kia was talking about a target of\Naround twenty thousand sales a year.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.86,0:13:29.25,Doc,,0,0,0,,But according to reports,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.30,0:13:33.93,Doc,,0,0,0,,fewer than four hundred Tasmans were\Nsold in the first nine months of 2026.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.98,0:13:35.85,Doc,,0,0,0,,So now Kia is cutting hard.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.90,0:13:38.43,Doc,,0,0,0,,According to a report published\Non the 4th of November,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.48,0:13:45.23,Doc,,0,0,0,,the 2025-model Tasman SX four-wheel\Ndrive is now $49,990 drive-away.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.28,0:13:50.31,Doc,,0,0,0,,Its list price was $54,490\Nbefore on-road costs,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.36,0:13:52.51,Doc,,0,0,0,,so that's around five\Nthousand dollars off.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.56,0:13:58.09,Doc,,0,0,0,,And the Tasman SX+ four-wheel\Ndrive is now $54,990 drive-away,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.14,0:14:02.73,Doc,,0,0,0,,down from $62,390 before on-road costs.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.78,0:14:05.45,Doc,,0,0,0,,Once you add in the on-road\Ncosts you'd normally pay,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.50,0:14:07.89,Doc,,0,0,0,,that's a saving of more\Nthan ten thousand dollars.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.94,0:14:12.11,Doc,,0,0,0,,ABN holders can also get five thousand\Ndollars off single and dual cab-chassis
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.16,0:14:15.03,Doc,,0,0,0,,S and SX models with an alloy tray.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.08,0:14:15.87,Doc,,0,0,0,,The catch?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.92,0:14:18.97,Doc,,0,0,0,,The deal is only on 2025 model-year cars,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.02,0:14:21.59,Doc,,0,0,0,,and you have to order and\Ntake delivery in November.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.64,0:14:23.09,Doc,,0,0,0,,So stock is limited.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.14,0:14:26.13,Doc,,0,0,0,,And with sales this low,\Nthink about resale value.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.18,0:14:29.69,Doc,,0,0,0,,A ute with a small fan base is\Nharder to sell in a few years' time,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.74,0:14:33.25,Doc,,0,0,0,,so plan to keep it for a while or make\Nsure the discount is big enough to
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.30,0:14:34.82,Doc,,0,0,0,,cover the extra depreciation.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.81,0:14:37.76,Doc,,0,0,0,,Before we finish, a bonus.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.81,0:14:40.95,Doc,,0,0,0,,This isn't a runout deal, but it's\Nthe biggest price cut I found.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.00,0:14:46.44,Doc,,0,0,0,,Audi has cut the price of the updated\NQ4 e-tron electric SUV by up to eighteen
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.49,0:14:47.22,Doc,,0,0,0,,thousand dollars.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.27,0:14:49.00,Doc,,0,0,0,,According to Cars24,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.05,0:14:54.20,Doc,,0,0,0,,the entry models are now\N$71,650 before on-road costs,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.25,0:14:56.14,Doc,,0,0,0,,about thirteen thousand dollars cheaper,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.19,0:14:59.44,Doc,,0,0,0,,and the all-wheel-drive quattro versions\Nare up to eighteen thousand dollars
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.49,0:15:00.40,Doc,,0,0,0,,cheaper.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.45,0:15:03.38,Doc,,0,0,0,,That brings them well under\Nthe luxury car tax threshold.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.43,0:15:04.00,Doc,,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.05,0:15:08.42,Doc,,0,0,0,,Because the current Q4 e-tron sold\Njust two cars in Australia in October,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.47,0:15:09.70,Doc,,0,0,0,,down 96 per cent.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.75,0:15:13.80,Doc,,0,0,0,,The catch is that deliveries of the\Nupdated model don't start until the first
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.85,0:15:15.33,Doc,,0,0,0,,half of 2027.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.17,0:15:18.30,Doc,,0,0,0,,So how do you get the\Nbest out of these deals?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.35,0:15:20.24,Doc,,0,0,0,,First, read the fine print.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.29,0:15:22.50,Doc,,0,0,0,,Look for words like "private buyers only",
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.55,0:15:25.00,Doc,,0,0,0,,"selected stock", "participating dealers",
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.05,0:15:28.24,Doc,,0,0,0,,"not combinable with other offers"\Nand "must be delivered by".
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.29,0:15:31.00,Doc,,0,0,0,,Most of these deals end\Non the 30th of November,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.05,0:15:34.30,Doc,,0,0,0,,the 21st of December or\Nthe 31st of December.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.35,0:15:39.02,Doc,,0,0,0,,Second, always ask for a final drive-away\Nprice in writing, for your postcode.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.07,0:15:41.22,Doc,,0,0,0,,Advertised prices can change by state.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.27,0:15:45.08,Doc,,0,0,0,,Third, prefer a real discount\Nover a fuel card or a gift card.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.13,0:15:48.26,Doc,,0,0,0,,A discount reduces what you\Nborrow and the stamp duty.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.31,0:15:50.60,Doc,,0,0,0,,Fourth, if a deal depends on finance,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.65,0:15:54.94,Doc,,0,0,0,,compare the interest rate and the total\Ncost of the loan, not just the bonus.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.99,0:15:57.10,Doc,,0,0,0,,Fifth, ask about demonstrators.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.15,0:16:00.54,Doc,,0,0,0,,Several of these deals, like\NSuzuki's, include demo stock.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.59,0:16:03.70,Doc,,0,0,0,,A demonstrator with a few thousand\Nkilometres can take another chunk off the
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.75,0:16:07.62,Doc,,0,0,0,,price, and it's usually still covered\Nby most of the new-car warranty.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.67,0:16:08.98,Doc,,0,0,0,,Just check the build date,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.03,0:16:10.32,Doc,,0,0,0,,the date the warranty started,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.37,0:16:13.92,Doc,,0,0,0,,and the service history, and make\Nsure the price reflects any wear.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.97,0:16:15.56,Doc,,0,0,0,,Sixth, timing.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.61,0:16:16.84,Doc,,0,0,0,,The last week of a month,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.89,0:16:18.72,Doc,,0,0,0,,and especially the last weeks of December,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.77,0:16:21.56,Doc,,0,0,0,,is when dealers are most\Ndesperate to hit their targets.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.61,0:16:23.78,Doc,,0,0,0,,If a deal ends on the 30th of November,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.83,0:16:26.90,Doc,,0,0,0,,don't be surprised if a new one\Nstarts on the 1st of December.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.95,0:16:30.72,Doc,,0,0,0,,But don't wait too long on limited\Nstock once the cheap cars are gone,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.77,0:16:31.50,Doc,,0,0,0,,they're gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.55,0:16:33.60,Doc,,0,0,0,,And finally, think about resale.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.65,0:16:36.58,Doc,,0,0,0,,The biggest discounts are usually\Non the cars that aren't selling.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.63,0:16:38.44,Doc,,0,0,0,,That's great for the price you pay today,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.49,0:16:40.48,Doc,,0,0,0,,but it can mean faster depreciation later.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.53,0:16:41.59,Doc,,0,0,0,,So that's the list:
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.64,0:16:44.02,Doc,,0,0,0,,Chery and Mitsubishi's fuel cards,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.07,0:16:47.54,Doc,,0,0,0,,Honda's gift cards, GWM, the Toyota HiLux,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.59,0:16:50.02,Doc,,0,0,0,,BYD's cashback, the Renault Duster,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.07,0:16:52.90,Doc,,0,0,0,,the Ford Ranger, Suzuki's\NBlack Friday sale,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.95,0:16:56.80,Doc,,0,0,0,,the BYD Atto 1 under twenty\Nthousand dollars and at number one,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.85,0:16:59.80,Doc,,0,0,0,,the Kia Tasman, with more\Nthan ten thousand dollars off.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.85,0:17:03.08,Doc,,0,0,0,,Now tell me in the comments: which of\Nthese deals would you actually take?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.13,0:17:05.44,Doc,,0,0,0,,And if you've been offered a\Nbetter deal at a dealership,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.49,0:17:07.92,Doc,,0,0,0,,share it below, because\Nit'll help other buyers.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.97,0:17:08.98,Doc,,0,0,0,,If this video helped,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.03,0:17:12.66,Doc,,0,0,0,,hit like and subscribe and share it\Nwith anyone who's about to buy a new car
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.71,0:17:13.80,Doc,,0,0,0,,before Christmas.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.85,0:17:15.03,Doc,,0,0,0,,See you in the next one.
